      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Total monthly option volume (volume) over all puts and calls, divided by monthly stock trading volume (vol). Exclude if price less than 1 or share code greater 11 or option volume or stock volume data are missing for the previous month. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=12.0；Sign=-1.0；TestInOP=port sort CAPM alpha nonstandard。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>1, shrcd<=11。 Notes：OP is actually weekly, and sorts in deciles, then longs 9+10 and shorts 1+2。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
